sequenceDiagram
    participant Player
    participant Game
    participant Worker
    participant Validator
    participant Runtime
    participant Profile
    Player->>Game: Submit source for Mica plan
    Game->>Game: Freeze observation, hash snapshot
    Game->>Worker: v1 execution request + observation copy
    Worker-->>Game: Plain-data evaluation + action plan
    Game->>Validator: Revalidate on current snapshot and game-owned rules
    alt Invalid or changed world
        Validator-->>Player: Reject + precise first failing step
    else Approved
        Validator-->>Runtime: Authorized bounded plan
        loop Fixed logical tick
            Runtime->>Runtime: Apply one allowed action to game-owned state
            Runtime-->>Player: Render interpolation + trace
        end
        Runtime->>Profile: Commit safe milestone, idempotent event and XP
        Profile-->>Player: Recovery-safe completion
    end
